# PreLife — production env template (for Render).
#
# Two ways to feed these to the Render deployment:
#
#   1. PREFERRED: Render dashboard → PreLife service → Environment →
#      add SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY as variables.
#      (Values set there are injected straight into the process env.)
#
#   2. Or copy this file to .env.production (git-ignored!) and fill in the
#      real values — `npm start` loads it via `node --env-file-if-exists`
#      and `next build` reads it at build time (NEXT_PUBLIC_* inlining).
#      Only do this if the repository is PRIVATE.
#
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://prelife.onrender.com
